    {
      "id": "8361a482-6b31-4bdd-a9c8-5ea1cb029793",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1008,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "# YouTube Transcript Downloader\n\nPaste a YouTube link into a simple form and get the video's transcript as a text file.\n\n## How it works\n1. User pastes a YouTube link\n2. Transcript is fetched\n3. Text is cleaned up\n4. Text is saved as a .txt file\n5. File is downloaded\n\n## Before you start\n- Get a free API key at **supadata.ai**\n- Put the key in **Step 2**\n- Click **Publish**, then share the form link"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2e8acca0-6c66-4f2d-b2de-1c8d3a9a05ae",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -448,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## Step 1: Enter Link\n\nThe user opens the form and pastes a YouTube video or Shorts link.\n\nClicking **Submit** starts the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3a1d33dc-930b-45fb-ad32-26e222c41af0",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## Step 2: Get Transcript\n\nThe link is sent to **Supadata**, which returns the video's transcript.\n\nYour Supadata API key is used here.\n\nIf the video has no captions, this step will fail."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1c5e06cf-0e99-4b2b-9c01-924815fa4cb4",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        192,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## Step 3: Clean Up Text\n\nThe transcript is tidied into clear, readable text.\n\nTo change how the text looks, edit the code in this step."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ed42b304-7e93-4439-ab9a-fcfd0f2ea17c",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 4",
